(74, 1, 1, 0, '2024-05-07', '4', 0, 'As per approval from SHA for tube machine for Hemas', '2024-06-30', 'Expansion', 3, 'We have been doing 100% of sanitary napkin bag business for Hemas but now customer has changed the format to tube as they have invested into an automated filling plant for which they require the packaging material in tube format instead of pre formed bags. With our existing set of hardware we cannot produce this type of product. \r\n \r\nBudgeted value for this business is Rs. 41 million/year and our CM in this category is average 40%. This investment will also enable us to capture the business of another market player ICL (brand name : EVA) which is already on the same tube format and being supplied by the competition.\r\n', 'Slit-sealing and Gusseting machine GM 300 delta', 'ahmed.hassan@packages.lk', 0, '1', 0.00, 10540000.00, 'USD', 34000.00, 310.00, 0.00, 1486000.00, 0.00, 250000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 12276000.00, '1.5 years', '71%', 0, 0, '0000-00-00', 0, 0, '0000-00-00', 2, 2, '2024-05-07', 2, 1, '0000-00-00', NULL, 1, '0000-00-00', '0', '0', 0, '0', '0000-00-00', 0, '0', '0000-00-00', '0'),
